  <section class="ea-gc__part ea-gc__part--steps" aria-labelledby="ea-gc-how">
    <h2 class="ea-gc__h2 ea-gc__visually-hidden" id="ea-gc-how">How to give a round of golf.</h2>
    <ol class="ea-gc__steps ea-gc__steps--strip" role="list">
      <li class="ea-gc__step">
        <h3 class="ea-story__heading ea-gc__step-heading"><span class="ea-story__number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span class="ea-story__heading-text">Pick the course</span></h3>
        <p>The one they keep talking about, or one from the list below.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="ea-gc__step">
        <h3 class="ea-story__heading ea-gc__step-heading"><span class="ea-story__number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="ea-story__heading-text">A gift card, or a booked tee time</span></h3>
        <p>A gift card lets them choose the day: many courses book only 1 to 4 weeks ahead, and many close in winter. Know their calendar? Book the tee time for them.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="ea-gc__step">
        <h3 class="ea-story__heading ea-gc__step-heading"><span class="ea-story__number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span class="ea-story__heading-text">Add something to unwrap</span></h3>
        <p>A gift card is flat. Add a <a href="{{ section.settings.unwrap_url }}">{{ section.settings.unwrap_label | escape }}</a> they can hold today.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
{%- else -%}

